          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "torch.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Watch out for the fire!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_430",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Konrad, it took you some time to rise this morning. I’m not angry, but I am worried. I won’t always be here to keep you safe!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I know, Delfador, and I’m sorry. This is horrible! How did the fires get so close without me noticing!?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I’ve never seen so many humans all in one place before. I can’t believe you and I are really the same as them..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("<i><b>I’m</b></i> sorry you couldn’t have grown up among your own people. Our kind can be a little crude, but we aren’t usually so bad — it’s Asheviere who’s stirred up all this mischief."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("And if my suspicions are true, this is merely a small part of the greater whole of her armies! We must get out of this forest so we can see what else is going on."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_431",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
